<div class="row justify-content-center">
<div class="col-sm-12">
<div class="card">
<div class="card-header text-white bg-primary mb-3"><a id="ConsentForm" name="ConsentForm"><strong>Maine DOE Media Consent Form</strong></a></div>

<div class="card-body">
<p data-end="184" data-start="0">The Media Consent Form grants the Maine Department of Education permission to use photographs, video, audio recordings, and other media of individuals who complete and sign the form.</p>

<p data-end="315" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" data-start="186">To ensure accessibility for as many families as possible, the form is available in the top 30 languages spoken by Maine families.</p>

